<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Despite our best efforts, we appreciate that sometimes things don't go to plan. We have received your intent to claim for 081-<strong>XXXXXXXX</strong> and have recorded your shipment details.<br />
<br />
The next step is to lodge a formal claim, which must be done by the reveuiver at the shipments final destination&nbsp;(in Australia or overseas). For claims lodged within Australia (domestic freight) these claims can be lodged by either the shipper&nbsp;<em style="font-size: 12px;">or</em>&nbsp;receiver.<br />
<br />
In order to lodge a formal claim, we need a few details from you, including:</span></span>
<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Reason for lodgment</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Number and weight of affected&nbsp;pieces&nbsp;</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Amount claimed ($ value)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Copy of airway bill</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Copy of 'intent to claim' acknowledgment receipt</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Copy of house airway bill (if applicable)</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">For:</span></span>
	<ul>
		<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">international claims - commercial invoice and/or packing list</span></span></li>
		<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">domestic claims - commercial invoice or Statutory Declaration declaring wholesale value of goods, description/nature of goods and that the declarant has not been able to claim from any insurance or other source</span></span></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Destruction certificate (if goods have been disposed)</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Repair quotation (where applicable)</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Evidence of attempts made to mitigate loss (if available)</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Copy of loss adjustor/marine surveyor's report (if applicable)</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Subrogation Letter</span></span></li>
</ul>
<br />
<span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>Domestic claims within Australia&nbsp;</strong><br />
If you're the <em>shipper </em>or <em>receiver&nbsp;</em>within Australia and you're lodging a formal claim for domestic freight within Australia, reply to <span style="color:#3498db;"><u>frtclaims@qantas.com.au</u></span> with the information above. Only one party - shipper or receiver - may lodge the formal claim.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
For time limitation on claims and actions, see below and refer to our <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/conditions-of-carriagedomestic.html#limitations-on-claims-and-actions">Domestic Conditions of Carriage.</a><br />
<br />
<strong>International claims within Australia</strong><br />
If you're the <em>receiver </em>and you're lodging a formal claim for international freight into Australia, reply to this email with the information above.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
For time limitations on claims and actions, see below and refer to our <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/conditions-of-carriage-international.html#limitations-on-claims-and-actions">International Conditions of Carriage.</a><br />
<br />
<strong>Claims out Australia</strong><br />
If you're lodging a formal claim for freight with a final destination outside of Australia, the <em>receiver </em>will need to contact their local <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/freight-terminals.html#international" rel="noreferrer noopener">Qantas Freight office</a>&nbsp;or ground handling agent, and follow their claims process as local regulations vary.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<strong>Time limitations</strong><br />
<br />
Time limits on lodging a formal claim are summarised below and further detailed in our <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/conditions-of-carriage-international.html#limitations-on-claims-and-actions" rel="noreferrer noopener">International Conditions of Carriage</a> or <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/conditions-of-carriagedomestic.html#limitations-on-claims-and-actions" rel="noreferrer noopener">Domestic Conditions of Carriage&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;<br />
<strong>For Domestic claims</strong></span></span>

<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Total loss - 120 days from issuance of airway bill</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Partial loss - 30 days from receipt of goods</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Damages - 30 days from receipt of goods</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Delay - 30 days from when the cargo was placed at disposal of person entitled to delivery</span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"> <strong>For International claims</strong></span></span>

<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Total loss - 120 days from issuance of airway bill</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Partial loss - 14&nbsp;days from receipt of goods</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Damages - 14&nbsp;days from receipt of goods</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Delay - 21&nbsp;days from when the cargo was placed at disposal of person entitled to delivery</span></span></li>
</ul>
<br />
<span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">If you need assistance lodging a formal claim or have any further questions, contact our Customer Service Team on 13 12 13 or respond to this email.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Thank you for your patience as we look to resolve your claim.&nbsp;</span></span><br />
&nbsp;
<p><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Kind regards,<br />
<b>Qantas Freight</b><br />
&nbsp;</span></span><br />
